- **q13 timeline + version-repick** `0f53284` (UNPUSHED) — (1) timeline-cell-resolver drops INVALIDATED before `pickLatestVidShot` (was version-blind → hid APPROVED v01 behind INVALIDATED v02); (2) FSM `INVALIDATED → {APPROVED,REVISION}`; (3) drawer mounts approve/reject on INVALIDATED; (4) strip frozen status token from displayed filename. +1 test.
