## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Direct render fire via `POST :8288/e/<INNGEST_EVENT_KEY>`** — `INNGEST_EVENT_KEY` ABSENT in main `webapp/.env.local`. Dev server accepts events at **`/e/devkey`** (any key in dev mode; many `scripts/*.ts` use this). Use `{name:'sandystudio/exec-vgen/single-shot', data:{episodeId, shotId, quality_tier:'standard'}}` — runner reads resolution from plan.
- **Premature "fal still locked" call** — I declared lock at monitor t+80s; sh11 actually SUCCEEDED at ~t+120s. Lesson: let the monitor finish before concluding.
- **Auto-firing paid renders blocked by money-classifier** — "restart"/"перезагрузка"/"raised ceiling" do NOT authorize hand-firing render events. Needs EXPLICIT per-run word (Director gave `q11a` = canary go). §10 "propose, don't auto-fire".
- **PowerShell here-string `git commit -m @'...'@`** mangles multi-line messages → use `git commit -F <tempfile>`.
- **`Remove-Item` on temp files** tripped a path guard once — harmless, left temp files.

