## Decisions Made

- **Anti-additivity throughout** — every fix reused existing surfaces (`.or` filter, atomic budget RPC negative delta, NonRetriableError, PilotApproveButtons, demoteSiblingApproved). No new agent (BOARD-FIN reused), no new schema.
- **INVALIDATED is NOT terminal** (q13) — Director may override and re-pick a superseded version; LOCKED is the only true terminal.
- **Canary-first for paid batches** — fire 1 shot, confirm green, then the rest. Caught nothing-broke but is the right discipline.
- **Mode 4 (AUTOTEST)** researched: auto-approves gates + auto-chains DAG, but critic→author revision loops DO run for real (cap=2 → HALT to Director). Real money if keys present (they are: FAL/OPENAI/GEMINI SET). Full episode ≈ $90–120 at 1080p (NOT $5000 — one agent hallucinated). Music/Suno = mock; publish = mock.

